            {
              "id": "KSV-0001",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Can elevate its own privileges"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A program inside the container can elevate its own privileges and run as root, which might give the program control over the container and node."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0001",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0001\nType: Kubernetes Security Check\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nCheck: Can elevate its own privileges\nMessage: Container 'shell' of Pod 'debug' should set 'securityContext.allowPrivilegeEscalation' to false\nLink: [KSV-0001](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0001)\nA program inside the container can elevate its own privileges and run as root, which might give the program control over the container and node.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0001**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|MEDIUM|Can elevate its own privileges|Container 'shell' of Pod 'debug' should set 'securityContext.allowPrivilegeEscalation' to false|[KSV-0001](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0001)|\n\nA program inside the container can elevate its own privileges and run as root, which might give the program control over the container and node."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "KSV-0003",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The container should drop all default capabilities and add only those that are needed for its execution."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0003\nType: Kubernetes Security Check\nSeverity: LOW\nCheck: Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all\nMessage: Container 'shell' of Pod 'debug' should add 'ALL' to 'securityContext.capabilities.drop'\nLink: [KSV-0003](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003)\nThe container should drop all default capabilities and add only those that are needed for its execution.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0003**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|LOW|Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all|Container 'shell' of Pod 'debug' should add 'ALL' to 'securityContext.capabilities.drop'|[KSV-0003](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003)|\n\nThe container should drop all default capabilities and add only those that are needed for its execution."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "LOW"
                ]
              }
