              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Security best practices require containers to run with minimal required capabilities."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0004",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0004\nType: Kubernetes Security Check\nSeverity: LOW\nCheck: Default capabilities: some containers do not drop any\nMessage: Container 'shell' of 'pod' 'debug' in 'default' namespace should set securityContext.capabilities.drop\nLink: [KSV-0004](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0004)\nSecurity best practices require containers to run with minimal required capabilities.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0004**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|LOW|Default capabilities: some containers do not drop any|Container 'shell' of 'pod' 'debug' in 'default' namespace should set securityContext.capabilities.drop|[KSV-0004](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0004)|\n\nSecurity best practices require containers to run with minimal required capabilities."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
