            {
              "id": "KSV-0006",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "hostPath volume mounted with docker.sock"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Mounting docker.sock from the host can give the container full root access to the host."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0006",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0006\nType: Kubernetes Security Check\nSeverity: HIGH\nCheck: hostPath volume mounted with docker.sock\nMessage: Deployment 'web' should not specify '/var/run/docker.socker' in 'spec.template.volumes.hostPath.path'\nLink: [KSV-0006](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0006)\nMounting docker.sock from the host can give the container full root access to the host.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0006**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|HIGH|hostPath volume mounted with docker.sock|Deployment 'web' should not specify '/var/run/docker.socker' in 'spec.template.volumes.hostPath.path'|[KSV-0006](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0006)|\n\nMounting docker.sock from the host can give the container full root access to the host."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "KSV-0009",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Access to host network"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Sharing the host’s network namespace permits processes in the pod to communicate with processes bound to the host’s loopback adapter."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0009",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0009\nType: Kubernetes Security Check\nSeverity: HIGH\nCheck: Access to host network\nMessage: Deployment 'web' should not set 'spec.template.spec.hostNetwork' to true\nLink: [KSV-0009](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0009)\nSharing the host’s network namespace permits processes in the pod to communicate with processes bound to the host’s loopback adapter.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0009**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|HIGH|Access to host network|Deployment 'web' should not set 'spec.template.spec.hostNetwork' to true|[KSV-0009](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0009)|\n\nSharing the host’s network namespace permits processes in the pod to communicate with processes bound to the host’s loopback adapter."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
